## Title: Error Catcher
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.4.1
## AddOnVersion: 401
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: The author's personal debugging tool, published only so it can be installed on a console. It writes to LibConsoleLogger: each Lua error with its whole call chain, every dialog shown and who asked for it, which add-on wraps which game function, the moment a button is built that the game does not trust, the add-on memory as it grows, and how the last UI load ended.
## SavedVariables: ErrorCatcherSavedVars
## IsLibrary: true
## DevId: e5653713-b8c8-4408-9f6b-3ca2cad33006

